  "limitations": [
    "This is a DTD-free UTF-8 admission profile, not a general XML processor or full XML/W3C certification. DTD-bearing documents, alternate encodings/versions and documents beyond local budgets are intentionally rejected even when valid under another XML profile.",
    "The recognizer checks syntax and namespace constraints, not DTD/XSD/RelaxNG validity, XML signatures, application schemas, content safety, authorization or intent. Accepted SVG/XHTML is not declared safe to render.",
    "Namespace identifiers are compared exactly after XML attribute normalization. ASCII whitespace/control values are rejected, but arbitrary namespace URI-reference syntax is not fully validated.",
    "Incomplete or unknown-total ranges and missing/other media types are not sniffed, repaired or assembled across responses. Direct Go HTTP consumers must invoke CheckResponseBody for ordinary/single-range content admission.",
    "The independent mutation oracle is limited to ASCII grammar and the observed Expat version. Fifth Edition Unicode names are covered by explicit normative boundary fixtures because older library tables reject some legal names.",
